<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Getronics.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Getronics.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued a total of 20 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on shares of Getronics NV, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUES/FFT/STUT	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  68 DFL (FOREX FIX 0.8879 NLG/DEM)</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	75 NLG     0.83 NLG  24.04 PCT    7.27 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	85 NLG     0.98 NLG  41.23 PCT    6.16 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
